OL,12, FTeletextC64EUltimateG-BWiC64 edition  
OL,14,CAbout                                  
OL,15, The Wireless interface for C64 - SX64 -
OL,16, C128 - VIC20.                          
OL,18, TheFWiC64Gis a high-speed, plug-in WiFi
OL,19, accessory that connects to the user    
OL,20, port of Commodore computers to provide 
OL,21, full internet access. It loads data and
OL,22, programs super fast.                   
