OL,5,CWiC64 Portal                           
OL,6, What is great about theFWiC64Gis that  
OL,7, it has it's ownBPortalGfilled with apps
OL,8, that make use of the WiC-capabilities. 
OL,9, There are apps for chat, radio, Google 
OL,10, Maps to name a few. And Teletext!      
OL,12, It also hosts a lot of games which save
OL,13, high scores online, So you can compare 
OL,14, them between players. Sweet!           
OL,16, To runFTeletextC64EUltimateGyou don't  
OL,17, have to install anything. Just run the 
OL,18,FWiC-launcherGprogram, go to theBAppsG  
OL,19, section and you'll findBTeletext       
OL,21,CMore info:Fwic64.net                   
